\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S Party Chat - Rab\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Rab\cell I'm sorry to have to ask ye for help like this so soon after yer fight, laddie, but I'd never be able to find Jade without ye.\par
\par
Now, the last time she was spotted was over near the orphanage where Vince lives. I'd say we need to start our search there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Jade was last seen walking near the orphanage, right? And when we sniffed around there, we found stairs leading down here...\par
\par
Don't try and tell me that's a coincidence, laddie. No, that lass's around here somewhere, mark my words!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, it's a real shame about that Rainbough. I was absolutely convinced ye'd have some kind of vision or something, laddie.\par
\par
Anyway, there's no use crying over spilt milk. We need to get moving. Ye never know when those soldiers will be coming back for us...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1210\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, ye saw the vision, laddie. We need to collect those six orbs and take them to the First Forest.\par
\par
Sounds simple enough, eh? Except we've no idea where to find them. We need to ask around and see if anyone can help us find those wee balls.\par
\par
Now, I'd say the first order of business is to go to Puerto Valor, open the gates, and head out onto the high seas. Let's head down there, quick sharp.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell What are ye doing, laddie? I don't think we've any reason to be gallivanting around here, do we?\par
\par
The gates are open in Puerto Valor, so let's sail out onto the high seas and see what we can find, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1512\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, ye saw the vision, laddie. We need to collect those six orbs and take them to the First Forest.\par
\par
Sounds simple enough, eh? Except we've no idea where to find them. We need to ask around and see if anyone can help us find that bunch of wee balls.\par
\par
Now, I'd say the first order of business is to go to Puerto Valor, open the gates and head out onto the high seas. Let's head north-west of here, laddie.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Servantes is on standby to open the sea gates just as soon as we're ready, laddie. I hope ye're all set to travel to pastures new!\par
\par
Now, if there's nothing else ye need to do around these parts, let's hop on board the Stallion! Once we've sailed through Puerto Valor, we'll be out on the open sea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Now I know this is the kind of place that makes ye want to sit in the sun and forget all yer troubles, but we've got things to do. Maybe next time, eh?\par
\par
We need to go and talk to Don Rodrigo. He's in charge of the sea gates, ye see. He lives in the biggest villa in town, if I remember rightly.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, it's a shame Don Rodrigo wasnae around. I'd been looking forward to having a wee chinwag with him. There aren't many who've got his depth of knowledge, let me tell ye!\par
\par
Still, it was nice to see Servantes looking hale and hearty. I'm sure the three of us will have a wee dram together once all this is over.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell\lquote Slow and steady does it...\rquote  That's what that wee bunny girl just told me. And ye know what, laddie? I think she might have a point.\par
\par
So if ye think yer auld Grampa's going to tell ye to get moving, ye're wrong! Take all the time ye need to enjoy this place! That's what I'll be doing, believe you me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Servantes is on standby to open the sea gates just as soon as we're ready, laddie. I hope ye're all set to travel to pastures new!\par
\par
Now, if there's nothing else ye need to do around these parts, let's steer the Stallion out towards the open sea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The gates in Puerto Valor are open, and the open sea's ours to explore! Let's see what we can discover, laddie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, I still cannae believe it, laddie! I thought ye were dead, but no, here y'are. And what a fine young man ye've become!\par
\par
Now, I know I've not been around for ye till now, but I'm going to be making up for that. Whatever I can do to help ye, just say the word. That's what family's for!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ......\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye know, I'm sure I've seen that wee Dora lass before somewhere. And not too long ago, either..\par
\par
Ach, curse this memory of mine! I'm probably getting her mixed up with some other bairn.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Today's the day, laddie. We need to head over to the Nhou Wat ruins on the other side of that hill.\par
\par
I've a funny feeling we need to take a good look at that mural. Don't ask me why\emdash ye just get a sense for these things when ye get to my age.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We only came here searching for a clue about where to go next. The last thing we expected to find was a giant haunted mural!\par
\par
Things like that don't just exist in isolation, laddie. I've a funny feeling that painting holds secrets we need to uncover. Well, only one way to find out...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Owww... My poor jacksie! That bumpy landing's given me a terrible bruise on the behind.\par
\par
I could do with a wee lie down, if I'm honest with ye, but I'll soldier on.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye don't need me to tell ye this, laddie, but ye'll be wanting to keep yer wits about ye. One false step at this stage and ye're bound to come a cropper...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell That magic key of ours should open up some interesting new areas, eh, laddie? Aye, I cannae wait to start exploring again!\par
\par
Now, I've seen that magic key symbol in all sorts of places. Just off the top of my head, there's the ruins of Zwaardsrust, near the Warrior's Rest Inn...\par
\par
Then there was one up in a kingdom by the name of Sniflheim, far north of this wee beach known as the Strand...\par
\par
...What? Ye want more? Heh! I'd say that's plenty for ye to be getting on with, laddie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I've seen a fair bit of the world, laddie, but I've never seen anything quite like this before.\par
\par
What happens next is anyone's guess\emdash all I know is that we need to stick together and stay safe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This isn't good, laddie... Did ye see the hollow look on those people's faces? And what about the things that painting was telling us!?\par
\par
I've got a terrible feeling that this isn't going to end well. Let's head after those people. I don't think they're capable of looking after themselves.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So this mural's cursed, is it? And it's been that way for centuries, by the sounds of it...\par
\par
Right, laddie. Let's go. Someone's got to put a stop to this reign of terror\emdash and there's no time like the present!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Heaven knows what would've happened if ye hadn't saved us from those tentacles, laddie.\par
\par
Aye, this place is nasty, and no mistake. Let's get out of here as soon as we can, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye heard what she said, didn't ye, laddie? That name again. Mordegon...\par
\par
He was the one who reduced this place to ruins, mark my words, and he'll be looking to do it again somewhere else. But we're not going to let that happen, are we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, now I remember why I wasnae so keen on Phnom Nonh... All those stairs and slopes everywhere! They play havoc with my poor knees!\par
\par
D'ye know what I fancy more than anything when all this is over? A nice hot bath...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell D'ye know what, laddie? When ye get to my age, it really warms the cockles of yer heart to be surrounded with bairns who are full of hope for the future. Just being here makes me feel young again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We need to collect the six coloured orbs and take them to the First Forest, laddie.\par
\par
If the vision we saw was right, doing that will open up the path to Yggdrasil...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The plan was to see if King Gustaf would lend us his orb, but that doesn't look like it's going to be possible now.\par
\par
We should try and find out what happened here, laddie. We can worry about the orb later...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If all goes to plan, we'll be leaving here with another orb to our name. I know for a fact that King Gustaf has one, y'see, and I'm pretty sure I could persuade him to hand it over.\par
\par
Now, if we could just find a way to get inside...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I cannae remember if I told you this already, laddie, but King Gustaf's orb is part of Sniflheim's royal treasure trove.\par
\par
Now, the King's an auld pal of mine, so if I just have a wee chat with him I'm sure he'll hand it over. Come on, let's head for the castle without further ado!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If all goes to plan, we'll be leaving here with another orb to our name. I know for a fact that King Gustaf has one, y'see, and I'm pretty sure I could persuade him to hand it over.\par
\par
So let's head for Sniflheim and have a wee chinwag with His Majesty!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, I remember reading about some terrifying valley where flocks of Hades condors make their nests...\par
\par
If that's not where we are, I'll eat my hat\emdash unless some pesky bird pinches it off my head first!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, laddie, we got the Green Orb\emdash and that means we're just that wee bit closer to Yggdrasil.\par
\par
Let's take things one step at a time and we're bound to get there in the end.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Jings, laddie, this place is some kind of paradise! All the mermaids are just as bonnie as wee Michelle!\par
\par
Thanks for bringing us down here. Ye've made an auld man very happy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ......\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If it's information ye're after, ye're best headed to whatever place people get together. Inns, taverns...or in the case of a wee fishing village like this\emdash the harbour. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Reckless, that's what it is! They're fishermen, not fighters\emdash they don't stand a chance against a maddened tentacular.\par
\par
Come on, laddie, let's head over and give them a hand, shall we? We'd be wise to kit ourselves out for a fight before we set sail, mind. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So it wasn't just a fairy tale... These people are convinced that Michelle stole Kainoa's soul.\par
\par
D'ye really think a lovely lassie like her would go round putting curses on people? It doesn't make any sense... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We've come this far, laddie\emdash we can't back out now. It's time to bring Michelle and Kai together\emdash the rest they'll have to work out for themselves. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Chin up, laddie. What's done is done, no matter how much we might wish it wasn't.\par
\par
What's important now is to take that sadness and anger, and set about putting things right. That's what being a true hero's all about. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Poor auld Kai and his mother, eh? They've had to live their whole lives with everyone suspecting them of being something they're not...\par
\par
They could have run away\emdash made a new life elsewhere\emdash but they've stuck it out and made a life for themselves here in Lonalulu. Aye, they're real tough cookies. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If a mermaid leaves the sea and makes the land her home, if ever she gets wet again, she melts away to foam...\par
\par
Mermaids are such beautiful creatures, but they're more fragile than I ever knew. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Kai's finally rid himself of the mermaid's curse. Now he can live his life without that shadow hanging over him.\par
\par
It wouldnae do for the poor lad to end up like his auld grandpa, living all alone on this forsaken shore. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell They say the most beautiful thing in the world is either the full moon on a cloudless night, or the face of a mermaid. Well, now that I've seen a mermaid for myself, the moon looks like a dog's breakfast!\par
\par
This Kai lad must be an absolute dreamboat to have a bonnie lass like Michelle pining after him! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye cannae fault Michelle's commitment, the way she's waiting here so patiently, not knowing when her man will come back...\par
\par
If I were Kai, I'd drop everything and head over here like a shot, even if I had to swim all the way from Lonalulu! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell No matter how much it might grieve the poor wee lassie, her fianc\f0\'e9's gone. And once someone's gone, ye cannae bring them back.\par
\par
Time flows differently for mermaids and men. Kainoa was caught by the current and drifted away... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye heard what Michelle said, did ye not? That if a mermaid ever leaves the sea, she can never go back, or she'll turn to foam.\par
\par
It's a big risk, swimming over to a human village\f1\emdash\f0 if one of those fishermen caught her and pulled her out of the water, her jig'd be up.\par
\par
But the poor wee lassie's got her heart set on meeting Kai. All we can do is make sure she gets to Lonalulu safe and sound. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell To the mermaids, our lives must seem to come and go in the blink of an eye.\par
\par
Aye, and they're not wrong\f1\emdash\f0 we've no time to lose! Until the day that Mordegon's gone for good, we've got to keep moving! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Mermaids live for five hundred years, the poor lassie's sure to learn of her fianc\'e9's passing one day...\par
\par
Till then, though, she can live here happily, waiting for her man to come. Let's leave the girl to her daydreams, shall we? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems Michelle wasnae just one in a million. Every one of these mermaid girls are absolute knockouts!\par
\par
Hyeh heh heh. Thanks for bringing me down here, laddie\f1\emdash\f0 I thought I'd have to pop my clogs before I made it to paradise! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Now we've got our hands on the Green Orb, we're one step closer to making our way to the World Tree.\par
\par
Still, there's no need to rush\f1\emdash\f0 just take it one step at a time, and we'll get there in the end. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Reckless, that's what it is! They're fishermen, not fighters\f1\emdash\f0 they don't stand a chance against a maddened tentacular.\par
\par
Come on, laddie, let's try and find the fleet before it's too late. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If we play Lorelei's harp over the shining whirlpool in the middle of the inland sea, we'll be dragged down to Nautica\f1\emdash\f0 the home of the mermaids.\par
\par
But that isn't the only whirlpool around, is it? I wonder where the others lead to... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell What's the idea bringing us here, laddie? Are we not going to find out what happened to that Orb that sank to the bottom of the sea?\par
\par
I mean, I've been really looking forward to meeting the queen of the mermaids. I've combed my moustache and everything... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Tell me, laddie\f1\emdash\f0 have ye found yerself a girlfriend yet? Och, it's a fine thing, love\f1\emdash\f0 it makes yer heart go pitter-pat!\par
\par
When I was your age, I had to beat the girls away with a stick! ...Literally! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Jings! One minute we're at the bottom of the ocean, the next we find ourselves in the Champs Sauvage!\par
\par
How long has it been since me and the Princess last set foot here? It can only be fate that's brought us back! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Here to get some practise talking to girls, are ye? Hyeh heh! When I was your age, they were the ones who came to me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I once read about a terrifying valley that's ruled over by a gang of vicious Hades condors...\par
\par
