\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The Sn\'e6rfelt's a bitter place, even by Sniflheimian standards. Even the local hunters don't dare stay out here too long\f1\emdash\f0 soon as they've checked their traps, they high-tail it back to the city before they freeze to death! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Michty me, this forest just goes on and on! You could easily lose your way among all these identical trees.\par
\par
The only thing we've got to guide us is the river. We'd be wise not to stray too far from it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So auld J\'f6rmun had the power to seal away the witch's magic... That's a rare talent, and no mistake. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Could this be the legendary Royal Library of Sniflheim? I've heard tales about the place, but I was never sure how many of them were true.\par
\par
They say it was built in the Age of Heroes to house the combined knowledge of all humankind. Some call it the \lquote Pinnacle of Wisdom\rquote .\par
\par
Chances are there's a fair few volumes in here that'll come in handy on our little adventure. If ye spot anything that looks useful, be sure to read it from cover to cover! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell About that book I borrowed the last time I was here... It's what ye might call a \lquote gentleman's magazine\rquote\f1\emdash\f0 a publication filled with pictures of\f1\emdash\f0\par
\par
...Ach, but I shouldn't be telling ye this. You're at an impressionable age, laddie...and trust me\f1\emdash\f0 this stuff makes an impression! Whisht! I'll say no more! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Did ye know this academy's famous for its magical meals?\par
\par
