\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, things are certainly looking up for the people of Hotto now they don't have a horrible dragon to be worrying about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
