\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, this is the life! I'd love a wee cup of tea and a lie-down in the sunshine!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
