\pard\intbl Rab\cell .........\par
\par
...Sorry, laddie. I was miles away. Now, let's get to Heliodor. We've got some feasting to do!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I never thought I'd see the World Tree up close... It's funny how life turns out, eh?\par
\par
Now listen, laddie. I just know that Irwin and Eleanor are looking down on ye, and I know that they're smiling. This is their wee boy's big moment!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I always wondered how we'd actually get up to the World Tree... Turns out we'll be using some flashy bridge! Aye, it was never going to be boring, eh?\par
\par
Now come on, laddie! If ye want to learn how to dispel the darkness, we're going to need to pay a visit to the Heart of Yggdrasil!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It's been quite a journey, laddie, but ye've finally managed to get yer hands on the Sword of Light.\par
\par
Now, make sure ye look after it, won't ye? Ye know as well as I do that it isn't the kind of sword ye find every day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, I'd been hoping to go and tell Irwin and Eleanor that we've finally beaten Mordegon, but it seems I'll have to put that plan on hold.\par
\par
Come on, laddie. We've got falling stars to deal with!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Mordegon has been pulling the wool over everyone's eyes since the day Dundrasil fell...\par
\par
I cannae forgive him this! But we need to be careful, laddie. Who knows what he'll do when he's cornered.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ach, I'd been hoping to go and tell Irwin and Eleanor that we've finally beaten Mordegon, but it seems I'll have to put that plan on hold.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell What are we doing wandering around here, laddie?\par
\par
We need to get back to the castle and track down that imposter, quick smart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell We're looking like a pretty formidable unit, laddie. I mean, ye've gone from strength to strength, and now we've got young Hendrik on board too.\par
\par
Still, I can't help feeling a wee bit nervous. There's something in the air, something dark and foreboding. I'm worried things'll get worse before they get better...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So this school is dedicated to turning wee girls into mini medal-appreciating young lassies, is it?\par
\par
I'm afraid someone's going to have to explain the connection between medals and refinement, because it's lost on me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell From what our new pal told us, this dark star may have something to do with the return of Calasmos...\par
\par
Ach, but I don't have the first clue who or what that is, or what we're supposed to do about it. Come on, laddie, let's start by talking to the Elder.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems ye're the light the world needs to banish the darkness, laddie. By my reckoning, that means ye were born to defeat Calasmos.\par
\par
And there was me thinking ye'd fulfilled yer destiny when we beat Mordegon. It seems ye've still got some work to do, eh!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The visions Yggdrasil has shown us seem to suggest that Cetacea is the key to reaching the Dark One.\par
\par
It's still far from clear how that's going to happen, though. Let's see what the final seedling's got to tell us, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, there's no doubt about it. The fellow we saw with the glowing mark on his hand must have been Erdwin, the first Luminary.\par
\par
Now, let's see what else these seedlings have to show us, laddie. With any luck, we'll find out how he managed to take on the Dark One.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems the Guiding Light has given ye the power to awaken the visions of the past that are concealed within the seedlings.\par
\par
With any luck, they'll show us a way to take on the Dark One. Now, let's see if we can find any more, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The Watchers are a canny bunch, no doubt about it. Their world is truly beyond our ken.\par
\par
I wouldnae be surprised if they know exactly how to get to that tower, so let's see what they have to say for themselves.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The Elder said that Mordegon always craved more power, and that he'd do anything to get his hands on it...\par
\par
Aye, that sounds about right. Up in Angri-La they talked about how hard he trained. How single-minded he was...\par
\par
It's just a shame he didn't choose to channel all that determination into something that'd do the world a bit of good.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The Watchers have been cut off from the human world for a long time. It'd be nice if they could come down for a wee visit once the Dark One is out of the picture.\par
\par
They're a friendly bunch, after all. I'm sure folks down on the surface would be happy to meet them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell You know, laddie, I always thought your destiny was defeating Mordegon, but it seems there may be a wee bit more to it than that.\par
\par
Either way, we need to take a closer look at that dark star, otherwise we won't have a clue what's going on.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems the Guiding Light has given ye the power to awaken the visions of the past that are contained in the seedlings.\par
\par
With any luck, they'll help us find a way to take on the Dark One. Let's see what they have to show us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Och, I still cannae get my head round it. Could the Lord of Shadows really have been born from the darkness within the mighty wizard Morcant?\par
\par
Look, I'm never going to forgive Mordegon for what he did, but the more I think about it, the more it seems like he was just another victim of the Dark One.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Listen, laddie. The Dark One's not like any enemy we've tangled with before. He's posed a mortal threat to our world ever since he first appeared.\par
\par
We need to be sure we're ready to face him, so honing our fighting skills in the trials of Zwaardsrust doesn't sound like a bad idea.\par
\par
If we put the work in and make sure we're in tip-top condition, there's no reason we cannae defeat Calasmos.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ah, this takes me back! I lived up this mountain when I was a wee lad. It wasnae easy, but those were great days.\par
\par
Aye, all those smacks I got on the jacksie feel like they were only yesterday...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell That tower's been there a long auld while if ye ask me, laddie.\par
\par
I'd love to look into its origins, but we haven't got time for that right now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Let's see if I've got this right, laddie... Serenica came to this tower hoping to be reunited with her lost love, Erdwin?\par
\par
Ach, but I just cannae imagine how she planned on doing that. Perhaps all will be revealed inside, though, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This tower uses some of the technology we saw in the Watchers' village, but it's got something that's all its own, too.\par
\par
I've got a feeling that whoever it was who built this place, it wasnae the Watchers...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell D'ye want to hear a story, laddie? Well, this place makes me think back to the time I first met yer grandmother.\par
\par
There was this bookshop in Dundrasil I liked to visit, and one day I went in and saw her standing behind the counter.\par
\par
Aye, she was a real vision. I took one look at her bonnie smiling face and fell head over heels in love. The rest, as they say, is history!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell To think, laddie, ye were a prince, but ye ended up growing up in a little village like this.\par
\par
Then again, if the people of Cobblestone hadn't taken ye in, I might never have met ye again. Aye, I owe them more than I can say.\par
\par
Once this is all over, I'm going to come back here and thank them properly.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, it's nice to see so many familiar faces making their way to Cobblestone. The place is certainly looking a lot livelier than it did when I first came here.\par
\par
Who knows, one day it might be a city to rival Heliodor! Hyeh heh heh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Och, laddie, ye've done well there! Gemma's a bonnie lass and no mistake!\par
\par
Yer parents would be over the moon, I just know they would. They're up there smiling down on ye both, ye can take my word for it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Sounds like you and Erik are having a grand auld time living together. Almost makes me feel a wee bit left out...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye've got yerself a bonnie lass there, laddie, even if she does have a habit of trying to do everything by herself sometimes.\par
\par
Mind you, maybe ye're not so different in that regard, eh? Aye, a right pair of peas in a pod you are.\par
\par
Now remember, if you ever need help with anything, let us know. That's what family and friends are for, after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, laddie? How are things going with young Serena?\par
\par
Listen, the important thing is that ye always treat each other with love and respect\f1\emdash\f0 not that I imagine that being a problem for the two of you, of course!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye'll be right as rain as long as ye're living with Sylvando, laddie!\par
\par
I bet you two have some good fun and all, eh? I've a mind to ask ye to let me swap places with ye sometime...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It brings me such joy to see you and Jade living together, laddie\f1\emdash\f0 the royal families of Dundrasil and Heliodor united, at last!\par
\par
Both of you mean so much to me, and I wish you all the happiness in the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I haven't a bad word to say about anyone in this village, laddie. Ye fell on yer feet when ye washed up here, that's for sure!\par
\par
And I'll tell ye who else has fallen on his feet: me! Living with their wee grandkid's every grandad's dream!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I haven't a bad word to say about anyone in this village, laddie. Ye fell on yer feet when ye washed up here, that's for sure!\par
\par
Now, if ye don't mind, there's something I'd like to do, just the two of us. Would you join me on a walk up Cobblestone Tor, laddie?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well laddie, how's life with Hendrik treating ye? I bet ye're getting in plenty of sword practice.\par
\par
Do let me know the next time ye decide to have a duel. I'm getting a wee bit rusty myself and wouldn't mind putting you boys through yer paces!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I heard all about that wee adventure ye had when ye climbed the Tor for yer coming of age ceremony.\par
\par
Ye saved Gemma's life, from what I'm told. Aye, it sounds like ye were a proper hero. I'm proud of ye laddie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I'm nothing but grateful for the fact we're able to live together after all those years apart, laddie.\par
\par
Ye make me so proud. I swear I'll never leave ye on yer lonesome again...\par
\par
Oh, and listen... Let me know if ye ever fancy having another wee peek at my magazine collection, alright? It'll be our little secret.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I cannae believe ye're that same wee baby I used to hold in my arms so long ago. It truly fills me with pride to see the fine figure of a man ye've become.\par
\par
By the way, didn't ye say that ye went to the top of this tor when ye came of age? I wouldnae mind seeing the view with my own eyes, if that's alright with you, laddie.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I cannae be sure, but it seems the regular folk of Heliodor weren't much affected by their king being possessed by Mordegon.\par
\par
If the truth hadn't come out, he'd likely still be seen as a normal ruler, hiding in plain sight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Jade's felt like a daughter to me for years now, but it's time for her to be with her real father.\par
\par
Now that Mordegon is no more, my auld friend Carnelian can begin to make up for lost time and start getting to know his beloved daughter. Aye, they've a bright future ahead of them, I'm sure of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Jasper was our enemy for a long time, but I don't bear him any grudges. No, in the end he was just a sad, confused young man.\par
\par
Perhaps all he wanted deep down was a true connection with others. It was when he couldn't find it that he turned to the darkness and things started to go very, very wrong...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Laddie, ye've no choice but to leave this fight to Hendrik. He's decided he's going to take on his auld friend alone, and there isn't a thing in the world anyone can do to dissuade him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, thinking back to the day Dundrasil was attacked, we all lost so much. Not least Hendrik and Jasper...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...Hm, I cannae for the life of me work it out. The roots of Yggdrasil are only meant to show ye visions of things that've actually happened. But what we saw was different...wasn't it?\par
\par
I mean, it was Heliodor Castle, but it was in a right auld state, and as for Jasper? Well, he was more beast than man. Och, it's all very strange...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell To be honest with ye, I prefer nice down-to-earth places like this to hanging about in stuffy castles.\par
\par
The folks here have spirit, which is more than I can say for most of the stuck-up snobs ye meet when ye're hanging around with royalty.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ah, good auld Hotto! Come on, laddie, since we're here, we've got to pay a visit to the bathhouse!\par
\par
It'll get rid of all yer aches and pains, I'm telling ye! Last time, I spent so long stewing in there that Jade had to threaten to physically remove me herself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I know this might sound a wee bit odd, but I'm slightly envious of Miko.\par
\par
I mean, she managed to save her son. I never had the chance to save my daughter or her husband...\par
\par
Thank goodness I've still got you, eh, laddie? Life does go on, after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Och, I've never felt anything quite like this before, laddie.\par
\par
If we don't do something about that star, it feels like evil is going to consume the whole world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems the Sultan's got himself pretty het up about this dark star. Well, I cannae blame him, but he needs to stay strong for his people.\par
\par
Still, when all's said and done, he'll always do what's best for his kingdom, I've not got the slightest doubt about that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I feared for my life when I first saw that horrible bunch of beasties, but we took care of them in the end.\par
\par
Now that things are back to normal, Gondolia will be flourishing again before we know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell These beasties are no pushover, laddie. I know ye want to rid the town of every last one of them, but there's no shame in beating a tactical retreat every now and then.\par
\par
If ye're not feeling up to the task, maybe it's best to head off and build up a wee bit of experience by fighting some slightly softer monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye know, laddie, it's amazing to think that I wouldnae have met ye again if it hadn't been for the Masked Martial Arts contest.\par
\par
Aye, I'm always going to have a soft spot for Octagonia, that's for sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell No one seems to have any idea what these ruins were used for. It's a total mystery.\par
\par
Perhaps once we've got all this business with the dark star out of the way, I'll come back here and do a wee bit of research. Who knows what I might uncover?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I remember the good auld days in Dundrasil. We'd get delicious fresh bread and fine wines delivered from Zwaardsrust.\par
\par
Ye know, it might not be a bad idea to spend a night in the Warrior's Rest. We can sample some of the local fare.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell When the world is at peace again, I'll have one last piece of unfinished business. I'm going to devote the rest of my life to rebuilding Dundrasil.\par
\par
I won't be doing it alone, though. No, ye'll be by my side, laddie, and yer parents will be looking down on us and smiling.\par
\par
Now let's get rid of that ugly great brute of a thing hanging in the sky! Then a new day can dawn for all of us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell When the world is at peace again, I'll have one last piece of unfinished business. I'm going to devote the rest of my life to rebuilding Dundrasil.\par
\par
We're going to have to get rid of that ugly great brute of a thing hanging in the sky first, though. Then a new day can dawn for all of us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell When the world is at peace again, I'll have one last piece of unfinished business. I'm going to devote the rest of my life to rebuilding Dundrasil.\par
\par
I won't be doing it alone, though. No, ye'll be by my side, laddie, and yer parents will be looking down on us and smiling.\par
\par
Now let's get go and show Calasmos what for! Then a new day can dawn for all of us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell .........\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell These tunnels were built as an escape route, in case the castle ever came under siege.\par
\par
They're not much use to anyone now, but still I get this funny feeling that we're not alone down here. Let's keep our wits about us, laddie.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well laddie, there ye have it. The mightiest weapon in the world isn't a sword or a spear\f1\emdash\f0 it's teamwork. There are things we can do as a group that we could never do alone.\par
\par
If we can team up and work together, nothing can stand in our way, not even that horrible dark star.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, Don Rodrigo is an impressive fellow, alright. There aren't many knights like that left, and now he's put that wee misunderstanding with our Sylvando behind him, we've got him on our side.\par
\par
Right, it's time to find out more about this mighty weapon he mentioned. If that's what we need to get rid of that dark star, we'd better get our hands on it\f1\emdash\f0 and fast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, I'd heard something on the grapevine about Don Rodrigo's son Norberto going AWOL... But now it turns out he's none other than our Sylvando!\par
\par
That was all a long time ago now, though. I'd say Hendrik did well to work out who Sylv really was.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hyeh heh heh! Now here's an intriguing auld building I'd like to do a wee bit of research into!\par
\par
I'd heard rumours that knights trained here, but no one really knows who first built it. I'll have to do some digging into the archives when I have the time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Ye know, laddie, I'm not one to order ye around, but I cannae help but feel we have more important things we need to be doing.\par
\par
...Of course, if you fancied joining me in a wee wager, that'd be a different matter. Wait, no! We have things to do! Important things!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems the poor folks of Lonalulu cannae even enjoy their festival because of all the rampaging beasties running about the place.\par
\par
We need to get rid of that dark star quick smart\f1\emdash\f0 these folks deserve a good knees-up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If we don't do something about that dark star, this tropical paradise will be overrun by nasty beasties!\par
\par
Och, it doesn't bear thinking about! We cannae let that happen, laddie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I've got to hand it to that grey gordon, he knew how to move!\par
\par
He's not the only one, though! I like to think I've still got it. Just point me towards the nearest dance floor\f1\emdash\f0 I willnae let any mangy monster show me up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hustle! Hustle! Hustle!\par
\par
...Och, I'm sorry, laddie. Watching these folks going at it made me want to have a wee dance as well.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, I'd say this was the perfect place for any monsters that want to lie low...\par
\par
Which means there's a good chance that the horrible beasties which put that curse on the village are hiding out here. Well, we won't let them get away with it, will we laddie?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If the beasties in the sea are acting up, it's sure to disrupt the trade routes into Sniflheim.\par
\par
We cannae allow the kingdom to become cut off from the world. We need to do something about that dark star, laddie, and fast!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I'll be honest with ye, laddie. I did wonder if Queen Frysabel was tough enough to rule this kingdom. It seems she's making a decent fist of it, though, eh?\par
\par
Well, she isn't alone, of course. She's got Krystalinda on her side. Between them, I'm sure they'll do a great job.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Apparently the Hekswood is a haven for all sorts of plants and mushrooms. We cannae see them, though\f1\emdash\f0 they're all hidden under a thick blanket of snow.\par
\par
