\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell They say that in ancient times, some mighty genius created the first gentleman's periodical, the archetype for all that came after, including my beloved Ogler's Digest.\par
\par
Legend has it that Erdwin himself took the first copy of that organ with him on his epic journey, but that it hasn't been seen since. Ah, I'd give anything to have a wee peek at it! I wonder who's on the cover!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Well, laddie, ye did well to save Mia from her fate, but I still cannae believe what happened to the poor girl!\par
\par
Just imagine if she'd used that power in the service of evil. Och, it doesn't bear thinking about! The whole world would be gold-plated by now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I can sense ye're impatient to get on with saving the world, laddie, but there's no need to rush.\par
\par
Ye need to speak to all the folks ye can and see what ye can learn. And don't forget to chat to yer companions, too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Aye, Arboria's a pretty special place, alright. Its people have always known that their destiny is to guide the Luminary.\par
\par
Just as Serenica once did, Veronica and Serena set off to find you and guide you on your way. Och, they're a fine pair of lassies, they really are.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Och, that was a mighty wallop that Grand Master Pang gave me. She hasn't mellowed with age, that's for sure. My jacksie'll be red raw for a week!\par
\par
