\par
I've not been there myself, mind you, so it's probably better to take all that with a wee pinch of salt.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Erdrea doesn't belong to us humans, ye know. We share it with all sorts of other creatures: on the surface, in the air and under the sea.\par
\par
